Scope
=====

This repository contains two kinds of artefacts under different terms:

1. **Code** — Hugo configuration, layouts, scripts, build plumbing, and
   any source file outside `site/content.en/` and `site/content.fr/`.
   Licensed under the **MIT License** reproduced below.

2. **Editorial content** — the prose under `site/content.en/` and
   `site/content.fr/`. Copyright © 2026 Igor Casanova. All rights
   reserved. Ask before redistributing, translating, or reusing the
   text or its derivatives.

The vendored theme under `site/themes/hugo-book/` retains its own MIT
license from <https://github.com/alex-shpak/hugo-book>.


